      "seed": 1197222162,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 527271837,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795362535549,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 解决什么问题",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 解决什么问题",
      "lineHeight": 1.28,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_0026",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2384,
      "y": 488.1,
      "width": 2391.3,
      "height": 138.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 208186281,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 937859570,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795362535549,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 文本类基准（LoCoMo、LongMemEval）只测静态知识回忆，不测工具与动作执行；交互类基准（Evo-Memory、StuLife）又未同时解耦「回合内/跨回合」与「知识/执行」四类需求，\n   且部分未开源；\n2. 缺少统一基座与强长上下文对照，导致学术界不清楚显式记忆架构究竟在什么条件下优于直接塞上下文。",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 文本类基准（LoCoMo、LongMemEval）只测静态知识回忆，不测工具与动作执行；交互类基准（Evo-Memory、StuLife）又未同时解耦「回合内/跨回合」与「知识/执行」四类需求，\n   且部分未开源；\n2. 缺少统一基座与强长上下文对照，导致学术界不清楚显式记忆架构究竟在什么条件下优于直接塞上下文。",
      "lineHeight": 1.65,
      "autoResize": true
    },
